5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about the silence. We need to know what the cold months actually cost us before we agree.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,The tension is real. I want to see where the money has already hurt our relationships.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,It feels unfair. I just want to know if the current split is truly equal for everyone.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I need to see the full year. I can’t commit to a surprise bill in February.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about the time it takes. Who is actually doing the math every month?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, exactly. The winter bills are a shock. We need to see the history.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, I agree. If we don’t look at the past, the resentment will grow.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Daisuke, that sounds exhausting. I hope we can find a way that is simple.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, I’ll check the statements. I need to see the peak and the trough.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look at the logs. I need to see how long the settling up takes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the winter habits. I want to see how people behave when costs are fixed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll check the kitchen notice. I want to see what people did when the bill was high.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I’ll check the plug-in monitors. I want to see who uses the most power.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll check the electrician’s quote. I need to know the upfront cost of changing things.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the trial run. I need to see how hard the template is to use.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
