35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The winter habits show people leave heaters on if the cost is fixed. It feels safer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The kitchen notice stayed up all summer. People sweated rather than argue. That is a bad sign.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The monitors show one room uses four times more than another. That is a huge difference.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The electrician quote is 34,000 yen per room. That is a lot of money to start.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The trial run took hours. Keying in every invoice is a nightmare. I don’t want that job.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, 34,000 yen is steep. But if it stops the arguments, is it worth it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, four times more? That explains why people feel they are carrying others.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, I didn’t know it was that bad. I just want it to be fair.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, I can’t afford that upfront cost. I need to see the monthly variation first.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, the monthly settle at the other house took forty minutes. That is too long for me.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, forty minutes is a lot. But if we don’t do it, the resentment grows.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I agree. The payment log shows three late payments. The stress is real.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to cause trouble. I just want to understand.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, it’s not your fault. The system is broken. I need to see the statements.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I hope the statements show a pattern. I don’t want to be the one calculating.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
