60,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B seems best. Fixed rates mean we don’t have to calculate every month.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option A is too expensive. 34,000 yen is a barrier. Option C is too simple.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option B feels fair. If the cost is fixed, we don’t have to argue about usage.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"Option B is risky. If the bill is high, we lose money. But Option A is too costly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option B is the only one that doesn’t require me to do the math. I prefer it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the risk is real. But the peace of mind is worth it. I vote B.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I agree. The current system is souring our relationships. I vote B.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, I’m happy to go with the group. I vote B.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, I’m worried about the year-end settlement. But I can’t afford A. I vote B.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I understand. I vote B. It’s the least work for me.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
